[4769044656] Upstream Reporter: Jelle van der Waa
Upstream issue status: Open
Upstream description: {quote}Recently cloud-init started to fail:

{noformat}
[root@eln ~]# /usr/lib/systemd/system-generators/cloud-init-generator --debug
/usr/lib/systemd/system-generators/cloud-init-generator: line 51: /usr/lib/cloud-init/ds-identify: No such file or directory{noformat}
ds-identify is packaged inder /usr/libexec \(as expected):

{noformat}
[root@eln ~]# rpm -qal cloud-init | grep ds-iden
/usr/libexec/cloud-init/ds-identify{noformat}
According to @yselkowitz this is due to recent os-release changes.
{quote}
Upstream URL: https://github.com/fedora-eln/eln/issues/565

